    "advancement": {},
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 20th level, you can take on the form of an ancient force of nature, with an appearance of your choice. For example, your skin might turn green or grow a bark-like texture, your hair might become leafy or mossy, or you might sprout antlers or a lion-like mane.</p><p>As an action, you undergo this transformation. For 1 minute, you gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>At the start of each of your turns, you regain 10 hit points.</p></li><li><p>Whenever you cast a paladin spell that has a casting time of 1 action, you can cast it using a bonus action instead.</p></li><li><p>Enemy creatures within 10 feet of you have disadvantage on saving throws against your paladin spells and Channel Divinity options.</p></li></ul><p>Once you use this feature, you can’t use it again until you finish a long rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-OWWkGe4td0I6xG4k\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p><em>Transform</em> puts the effect on you; use <em>Regeneration</em> at the start of each of your turns while it lasts.</p></section>",
